{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Cap food prices and increase the cut on fuel duty",
        "additional_details": "There are frequent headlines suggesting that supermarkets, oil companies and big corporations are making record profits while many ordinary people struggle to afford food, fuel and basic essentials. In our view, successive governments have failed to help, and the latest Budget again failed to deliver the relief people desperately need. We believe that the British public have put up with this long enough and it's time for a change.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to introduce a cap on food prices and to increase the cut on fuel duty.",
